                                                        </constraints>
                                                        <string key="text">For security purposes, all Indian guests are required to present a valid government-issued photo identification at the time of check-in. Accepted ID proofs include Aadhaar card, passport, voter ID, or driving license. Please note that PAN card is not considered a valid form of identification for this purpose. We kindly request your cooperation in complying with this requirement to help ensure the safety and security of all our guests.</string>
